🇺🇸🇺🇦🇩🇪 AfD Leader "Opposes" German Ukraine Aid...

... So Did Trump...

▪️Fundamental structural realities have subordinated Germany to US interests including serving as an extension of US foreign policy abroad;

▪️No political party is even talking about these realities let alone discussing viable means of reversing Germany's subordination to the US;

▪️The AfD itself is ultimately backed by overlapping interests obediently advancing US interests at the expense of Germany, its people, and its future - making AfD simply another "flavor" of lies and false hope to dupe voters and move things forward another election cycle;

▪️The US has created similar bait and switch with "conservative/right" styled parties in France, Italy, and the UK - not to mention Trump and the GOP in the US itself;

▪️Just as Trump vowed to end wars including in Ukraine, but has only expanded, escalated and provoked even more wars, Germany's AfD will do exactly the same if/when they assume power;

▪️Political rhetoric is not a metric, it is specifically designed to distract people from actual metrics, like funding, associations/affiliations, and structural realities that reveal political campaign promises as transparent deceptions;

▪️Please stop listening to the rhetoric and study the structural realities the rhetoric is deliberately trying to distract us from.
